      "instance_name": "beach_walk",
      "label": "man walking on beach",
      "description": "A shirtless man is walking on a sandy beach, moving away from the viewer toward the ocean. He is positioned in the middle ground, with a rocky cliff on his left and ocean waves on his right. The scene is framed by natural elements, and the overlaid text adds a humorous, exaggerated context to his action.",
